      "alt": "A supplied one-day gift-kit case shows 120 kits, a $600 expense boundary and Calculate beside a pending Decision summary.",
      "caption": "Leah checks the supplied commitment in Forms. Calculate assesses the evidence and complete correction options in dependency order."
    },
    "calculationSummary": {
      "image": "/assets/use-cases/gift-kit-readiness/decision-summary-ui/03-one-day-decision-summary.png",
